+#### Step A.5.2 — Adopt /relay-test role
+
+Read `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/plugins/relay/commands/relay-test.md` and execute its full protocol inline.
+
+**On GREEN:**
+
+Append to `orchestrator_run_log`:
